	doc "Writes the matrix as a GPU buffer lays it out (std140 / std430: three columns of 4 floats, the 4th 0; 12 floats from the start of `into`; a shorter span is a fatal error)."
param into Span<float>
sheet body
node n00m00 Entry
node n00m01 Break Span<float>
node n00m02 Operator <
	in b 12
node n00m03 Branch
node n00m04 Fatal
	in message "ToStd430: the span holds fewer than 12 floats"
